# AWS Lambda Environment Configuration
# This file shows the CORRECT configuration for AWS Lambda deployment

# =============================================================================
# DATABASE CONFIGURATION (CRITICAL FOR LAMBDA)
# =============================================================================

# ✅ CORRECT: Use Transaction Pooler (Port 6543) for AWS Lambda
# This is the REQUIRED configuration for serverless environments
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.fxsjcrwsnnowlovcnddz:Arjava%402024@aws-1-us-west-1.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?connect_timeout=10

# ❌ WRONG: Do NOT use Direct Connection (Port 5432) for Lambda
