# =============================================================================
# NOTES
# =============================================================================
#
# 1. Transaction Pooler (Port 6543) is MANDATORY for AWS Lambda
#    - Designed for serverless/transient connections
#    - Handles high concurrency
#    - No prepared statements (handled by our code)
#
# 2. The connection string includes:
#    - Region-specific pooler: aws-1-us-west-1.pooler.supabase.com
#    - Port 6543 (Transaction mode)
#    - Query parameter: ?connect_timeout=10
#
# 3. Our code automatically:
#    - Uses 2 connections per Lambda instance
#    - Configures Fast recycling (no prepared statements)
#    - Sets appropriate timeouts for Lambda
#
# 4. For local development, you can use the same Transaction Pooler URL
#    It works for both local and Lambda environments
#
# =============================================================================
